<title>PHILIPPINES: DMCI says to buy 40 pct of Semirara Coal.</title>
<headline>DMCI says to buy 40 pct of Semirara Coal.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm DMCI Holdings Inc said on Tuesday its board had approved the purchase of 40 percent of Semirara Coal Corp held by Voest Alpine Machinery Contruction &amp; Engineering GmbH, a unit of VA Technologie AG.</p>
</text>
